{"unit_id":"EmberwingAviation__dsh-media-gen#card-card-zh","repo":"EmberwingAviation/dsh-media-gen","commit":"5a41152fee82060e50c8702192fe438581f9a810","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-media-gen 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的图片与视频生成插件，统一接入可配置的媒体供应商。它在 DSH 注册 image_generate、generate_video、animate_image 等工具，并提供图片和视频设置界面及视频画廊。用户可以根据提示生成图片、用参考图编辑图片、生成视频或将现有图片转成视频，还能查询任务并恢复已完成视频的下载。视频模型可按供应商配置并预览请求格式，产物可保存到工作区。使用前需在设置中配置媒体供应商及其凭据，提示词和素材会发送给所选上游服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-19","lib/image-core.js:587-594","lib/video-core.js:711-756","lib/video-model-manager.js:24-37"]}
{"unit_id":"EmberwingAviation__dsh-media-gen#card-card-en","repo":"EmberwingAviation/dsh-media-gen","commit":"5a41152fee82060e50c8702192fe438581f9a810","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-media-gen adds image and video generation to the DSH web client. Its tools create or edit images, generate videos, animate images, and recover video tasks. Provider settings and a video gallery are included. Configure a provider credential; prompts and media go to the selected service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-19","lib/image-core.js:587-594","lib/video-core.js:711-756","lib/video-model-manager.js:24-37"]}
