{"unit_id":"EmberwingAviation__dsh-media-gen#feature-feature-1","repo":"EmberwingAviation/dsh-media-gen","commit":"5a41152fee82060e50c8702192fe438581f9a810","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-media-gen 的功能「文生图与参考图编辑」：image_generate 根据提示词生成图片，也可接收一至五张对话图片作为参考；结果保存到工作区并在对话中展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/image-core.js:587-618"]}
